## THEME & CANVAS RULES (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

These rules protect the existing `dj_fit` theme from breakage:

### NEVER DO
- Hardcode colors, spacing, or font values in any new CSS
- Override Mercury/`dj_fit` component CSS files directly without a component-scoped file
- Add inline styles to Twig templates
- Rename existing SDC props that may be stored in the database

### ALWAYS DO
- Define new CSS values as `--hg-` custom properties in `src/schemes.css`
- Bridge new tokens to Tailwind in `src/main.css` via `@theme`
- Create new SDC components for paywall UI (upgrade prompt, membership badge, pricing cards)
- Register new SDC props in `[name].component.yml` so Canvas exposes them in the Properties panel
- Run `npm run build` after every CSS/Twig change
- Run `ddev drush cr` after every `.yml` metadata change

### New SDCs Required

| Component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `paywall_gate` | Overlay/replacement shown to non-members over gated content |
| `membership_badge` | Displays user's plan name + expiry in header/account area |
| `pricing_cards` | Displays plan options with purchase CTA |
| `member_dashboard` | Account page section showing membership status, billing, cancel |

Each must be created in `web/themes/custom/dj_fit/components/[name]/` following SDC structure.

